{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t政務司司長陳國基表示，因應宏福苑火災成立的獨立委員會，提出的120項建議，當中29項已推行，估計絕大部分會在明年完全落實。<br/>\n<br/>\n另外，行政長官已委任公務員敍用委員會，釐清公務員在事件中的責任，估計委員會會接見約100人，預料當中40至50人會被調查，預計明年一月向行政長官提交報告。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T01:23:55.679778+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:41:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T03:37:33.306414+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T01:17:34.593899+00:00","content_hash":"37486f93263cf48bd5db3d892fad34b26ade0b65d6d225880e983b5ec0fcb30c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}